OL,3,GNEWSATribute to former fighter pilot
OL,4,Aafter fatal car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a father-of-four who died
OL,7,Ffollowing a crash in the summer has
OL,8,Fpaid tribute to him.
OL,10,FClive Nigel Fitz, 93, was the driver of
OL,11,Fa silver Ford Focus when it was
OL,12,Finvolved in a crash with a black Kia
OL,13,FSportage and a Tesla at about 15:00 BST
OL,14,Fon 26 July on the A3023 Havant Road on
OL,15,FHayling Island.
OL,17,FHampshire police said the driver of the
OL,18,FKia and the three passengers in the
OL,19,FFord Focus suffered serious injuries.
OL,20,FThe force said Fitz, from Hayling
OL,21,FIsland, had since died.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
