OL,3,GNEWSATribute to former fighter pilot
OL,4,Aafter fatal car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute, his family said he was "a
OL,7,Ffighter pilot, school master, husband
OL,8,Ffor over 50 years, father of four boys,
OL,9,Fsports crazy, chatterbox, willing and
OL,10,Fable to engage anyone with friendly
OL,11,Fbanter".
